@0 = ~Warsling Sniper Kit for Fighters~
@1 = ~warsling sniper~
@2 = ~Warsling Sniper~
@3 = ~WARSLING SNIPER: The sling is a difficult weapon to master, but in the hands of a warsling sniper it becomes a precise tool of war. Although slings are commonly associated with and used by the hin, experts of the weapon may indeed come from any race.

Advantages:
-  +1 bonus to hit and damage with missile weapons at first level and every 4 levels afterward
-  At 10th level he gains the Improved Ricochet passive ability which allows all fired missiles to bounce off their primary target and hit one additional nearby foe

Disadvantages:
-  May not specialize in any weapon other than the sling
-  May not wear armor greater than studded leather
-  Hit Die: d8~

@4 = ~Original version~
@5 = ~This mod need BG2, BGEE, IWDEE, BG2EE, BGT or EET~

// composant 2
@6 = ~Add : Progressive learning of ricochets~

@7 = ~Add only : Abundance of ricochets a new passive abillity starting at level 24~

@8 = ~Abundance of ricochets : Add 5 % chance that one of the ricochets hit one ally at proximity~

// composant 4 (2)
@9 = ~Progressive learning of ricochets : Add a chance pourcentage that one of the ricochets hit one nearby ally~

@10 = ~Ability : Improved Ricochet~
@11 = ~Ability : Abundance of ricochets~

@12 = ~Ability : Chance to realize one additional ricochet~
@13 = ~Ability : Chance to realize two additional ricochets~
@14 = ~Ability : Chance to realize three additional ricochets~
// @15 = ~Ability : Chance to realize four additional ricochets~

@16 = ~This component need BG2, BGEE, BG2EE, BGT or EET~
@17 = ~This component need WarslingSniperKit main component~
@18 = ~This component need BGEE, BGT or EET~

@19 = ~Jaheira the warsling sniper~
@20 = ~Montaron the warsling sniper~
@21 = ~Yeslick the warsling sniper~
@22 = ~Deder the warsling sniper~

@31 = ~WARSLING SNIPER: The sling is a difficult weapon to master, but in the hands of a warsling sniper it becomes a precise tool of war. Although slings are commonly associated with and used by the hin, experts of the weapon may indeed come from any race.

Advantages:
-  +1 bonus to hit and damage with missile weapons at first level and every 4 levels afterward

-  At level 2, he gains 5 % chance that a fired missiles bounce off their primary target and hit one additional nearby foe
-  At level 4, he gains 10 % chance that a fired missiles bounce off their primary target
-  At level 6, he gains 30 % chance that a fired missiles bounce off their primary target
-  At level 8, he gains 70 % chance that a fired missiles bounce off their primary target

-  At 10th level he gains the Improved Ricochet passive ability which allows all fired missiles to bounce off their primary target and hit one additional nearby foe

- At level 12, he gains 30 % chance to make a second ricochet and hit two additional nearby foes
- At level 14, he gains 60 % chance to make a second ricochet
- At level 16, he gains 30 % chance to make a third ricochet and hit three additional nearby foes
- At level 18, he gains 60 % chance to make a third ricochet
- At level 20, he gains 30 % chance to make a fourth ricochet and hit four additional nearby foes
- At level 22, he gains 60 % chance to make a fourth ricochet

-  At level 24, he gains the Abundance of Ricochets passive ability which allows all fired missiles to bounce off their primary target and hit several nearby foes

Disadvantages:
-  May not specialize in any weapon other than the sling
-  May not wear armor greater than studded leather
-  Hit Die: d8~

